From 3074ec1f97bbc99e828af0d48a85abc951a9e706 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Codex <codex@local>
Date: Thu, 20 Aug 2026 21:11:17 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Input: import Fairphone FocalTech fingerprint shim

Import the fingerprint input subsystem published in Fairphone's official
kernel/qcom repository at commit
80da648332ffb13f3415224058d286e47429eca7. The source archive SHA-256 is
4f4bbe30774a1af4cc0242ac45359007dc35a58043c1498557f9a51db22ea6cd.

The driver files are verbatim. The only surrounding integration is sourcing
their Kconfig and descending into their Makefile from drivers/input.

